    {
      "id": "_sjmrHSjMplpkJ52dfPJZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2625.1037364452227,
      "y": 905.4066608591913,
      "width": 358.5646702997364,
      "height": 454.15708581936184,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 350512569,
      "version": 2279,
      "versionNonce": 1423175639,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792579521573,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Ideally Like LSM Trees,\nCompaction should opearte in a\n(CAS | Atomic) manner to avoid\ncorrupted Reads\n\n- We could do this by making BG-\nFlusher create Atomic new SSTables\non each flush | new Pages \n\n- Compaction | garbage collection\ncreate new compacted, vacummed,\nrelocated entires in a new file /\npage , atomically replace \n\n- pages => page directory CAS\n- files => atomic renamce\n\n** Core Idea, don't modify in-place",
      "fontSize": 20.184759369749415,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Ideally Like LSM Trees, Compaction should opearte in a (CAS | Atomic) manner to avoid corrupted Reads\n\n- We could do this by making BG-Flusher create Atomic new SSTables   on each flush | new Pages \n\n- Compaction | garbage collection create new compacted, vacummed, relocated entires in a new file / page , atomically replace \n\n- pages => page directory CAS\n- files => atomic renamce\n\n** Core Idea, don't modify in-place",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
